A||||6||Fireo16||Driver Test Question... HELP!!||||1||
Z||000000||Fireo16||08-27-2001||12:35 AM|||| Hi all, I'm taking my driving test tomarow and i have a question.<P> When turning, How do I do it? Hand over hand? or shuffeling my hands keeping them at 10 & 2?<P> My mother thinks hand over hand but my sis thinks shuffel.<P> Help plz I don't want to fail over something stupid like this.<P> Any other tips would also be helpful!||||reg||1
Z||000001||fropuff||08-27-2001||12:39 AM||||I don't think it'll matter, as long as you return to the 10/2 position after the turn.  I did the hand-over-hand thing, and still passed w/ flying colors.  <P>BTW: Welcome to the forum.  It IS spelled FIERO though.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000002||Urchin||08-27-2001||02:19 AM||||When I took mine I palmed it.  They told me after the test that the proper way is hand over hand.  Just for the record, I still passed.  I don't think they are too strict about that.  Good luck<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/side_cut_sig_4.jpg">  <BR>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Jaygee79||08-27-2001||02:25 AM||||It is hand over hand.  You should definitely do it for the test.  Most won't care, but you never know.<P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="purple">Jaime<BR>AOL IM: Jaygee79<BR>ICQ: 85931334</FONT><BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/jaygee79/index.html" TARGET=_blank>Jaygee79's Web Page</A><BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/peggypic.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||Indiana_resto_guy||08-27-2001||03:43 AM||||Whichever way is most comfortable for you.<BR>You MUST end up with a smooth movement throughout the turn, hand over hand is best. Both your hands can't be on the wheel ALL the time!<P>Good luck!||||reg||1
Z||000005||Monkeyman||08-27-2001||05:37 AM||||Just remember to put both hands back on the wheel when you're done turning.  And try not to be any more nervous than absolutely necessary.  It's only a test.  If you have to, you can retake it.  Not a big deal.<P>------------------<BR>'Consciousness:  That annoying time between naps.'<P>MM||||reg||1
Z||000006||Galen||08-27-2001||05:49 AM||||I wasn't nervous, hehe, I even forgot about that '10 & 2' thing.. I just lazily laid my hand on the steering wheel on one side and grabbed it on the  other at maybe 11 & 2.. that 99 GA was a dream. I caught myself being lazy and passed without a problem. I've only gotten two tickets since I've had my license, been stopped numerous times though. Wtf that wanna know why I was out at 10pm for.. he can kiss my white a... ummm.. ackbar. ayways. I'll stop rambling now<P>EDIT: Since fro wants to be so picky about words, its "Tomorrow"..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/sig.gif">    Ray -      <A HREF="mailto:galen@ezrpg.com">galen@ezrpg.com</A>      - <A HREF="http://www.fierolinks.f2s.com/" TARGET=_blank>www.FieroLinks.f2s.com</A> - AIM: GalenRPG - ICQ: 98668558<p>[This message has been edited by Galen (edited 08-27-2001).]||||reg||1
